
{0 OCaml TIFF}

OCaml TIFF is a library for reading and writing TIFF files.

{1 Getting started}

See the {{:https://github.com/geocaml/ocaml-tiff#readme}README}
for installation instructions and basic usage examples.

{1 API reference}

See the {!module:Tiff} module for the public TIFF API.

{1 Examples}

See the {{:https://github.com/geocaml/ocaml-tiff/tree/main/examples}examples} directory in the project repository
for sample programs.

{1 Contributing}

See {{:https://github.com/geocaml/ocaml-tiff/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md}CONTRIBUTING.md} for instructions on building,
testing, and contributing to the project.
